OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly       
OL,6,Fcloudy over the Western Isles with the 
OL,7,Fodd shower and winds becoming strong.  
OL,8,FFurther east will be dry with clear    
OL,9,Fspells developing and frost forming    
OL,10,Fovernight.                             
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and mostly cloudy in the 
OL,13,Fmorning and most of the afternoon with 
OL,14,Fsome bright intervals. Rain and hill   
OL,15,Fsnow, heavy at times, spreading east   
OL,16,Fin the evening.                        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
