OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStrong   
OL,6,Fwinds, rain and hill snow early Friday 
OL,7,Fclearing to bright spells and showers. 
OL,8,FBright spells and a few showers        
OL,9,Fpossible on Saturday. Heavy showers    
OL,10,Fspreading east Sunday. Often windy.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
